xplore the odd occurrences. If you can rally the call of your friends perhaps you can help us with this serious [problem].'\nYou say, 'A serious problem?'\nScout Miigle says 'Very bad news! Bidip Moktu, one of the leading officials in Gukta, has been captured by a Witness of Hate! We have sent a regiment to rescue him but they have not reported back. We need you to assist us in rescuing Bidip Moktu and putting a stop to whatever unnatural magic is occurring in Deepest Guk. Please say you'll return our people safely. Are you [interested]?'\nYou say, 'I am interested'\nScout Miigle says 'I hope to so Bidip Moktu again soon, and in one piece.'\nDeepest Guk: The Rescue is now available to you.\n_The entrance to the instanced zone is found in Innothule Swamp (marked on compass)._\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Deepest Guk: The Rescue.\n\n---\n\n_Bitle Cogswin is found just inside._\nYou say, 'Hail, Bitle Cogswin'\nBitle Cogswin says 'Ah yes you must be the group of volunteers sent by the wayfaring brotherhood. We have a very serious situation here and little time to resolve it. The prisoners have been placed in three separate rooms and each is guarded by Lich Rtrangi's minions. I am ready to teleport people to each area when you are ready, it would be wise to split into 3 groups of 12. I must warn you that once you have been teleported Rtrangi will be alerted so you must be prepared for an onslaught of enemies. Amongst these waves of minions please keep an eye out for the Ritualist Summoners. If they are able to complete the ritual preparations Rtrangi's power will triple. Each group of 12 must work in unison to destroy each Ritual Guardian at the same time and prevent the Ritualist Summoners from reaching Rtrangi, or he will be successful. When you are ready please tell me you wish to go to the vine room, the crevice room, or the aqueducts and I will port you there. Choose your 3 parties carefully.'\nYou say, 'I wish to go to the vine room'\nBitle Cogswin says 'I will send you there now. Please hurry we are running out of time.'\n_Split into three groups and port to the three different areas â€\" vine room, crevice room and aqueducts. There will be a lot of mobs in each area. Aqueducts area was the largest so have more people in that group. Find the Ritual Guardian in each area and kill all three together._\nYour victory has weakened a shroud of magic cloaking the dungeon's treasure.\nBitle Cogswin shouts, 'Now you have done it. The ritual has failed now all that is left is to destroy Rtrangi so that he can never try this again.'\nLich Rtrangi shouts, 'The time has come to make the final preparations. Go now my summoners and prepare the prisoners, let nothing stop you from executing your goal. Once you have returned to me I shall complete the ceremony.\nDecayed flesh and puss fly past you as the ritual summoners body falls to the floor his trapped soul released from its cursed shell.\n_Head west and kill Lich Rtrangi._\nFight information needed, as well as names of any quest items, additional rewards, etc.\n_Upon winning:_\nYour victory has shattered the shroud of magic surrounding the dungeon's treasure\n\n---\n\n_Known raid loot from this event (Two items per chest, can receive duplicates from the same chest):_\nRitualist`s Decaying Chest\nCursed Armlet of Guk\nLich's Shard of Vitality\nRitualist's Fury Stone\nShimmering Band of Velocity\nRtrangi`s Magical Chest\nFlowing Gem of the Ritualist\nCursed Stone of the Dead\nGravestone Fragment of Darkness\nShard of Burning Ooze\nWristband of the First Witness\nRtrangi`s Withered Remains\nHelm of Flowing Health\nCrimson Bauble of Rites\nGirdle of the Souless (sic)\nGlowing Gem of Enhanced Protection\nRecovered Shield of Respite\nShard of Guktan Hate\n- Crimson Bauble of Rites [item=64767]\n- Cursed Armlet of Guk [item=73082]\n- Cursed Stone of the Dead [item=67946]\n- Flowing Gem of the Ritualist [item=64810]\n- Girdle of the Souless [item=24079]\n- Glowing Gem of Enhanced 